<title>USA: Xomed Surgical stake held by Kingdon.</title>
<headline>Xomed Surgical stake held by Kingdon.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kingdon Capital Management Corp said Tuesday it holds a 5.51 percent stake in Xomed Surgical Products Inc, or 400,000 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions include buying 150,000 common shares Jan 10 at $12.10 to $12.81 per share.</p>
<p>Kingdon holds the stake for investment.</p>
</text>
